{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simple-730ml-kind-to-skin-micellar-cleansing-water-2608-0103","content_id":"c82ba2c3-a61c-428c-a27f-8ea621053c54","description":"Product Recall for Simple Kind to Skin Micellar Cleansing Water 200ml, 400ml and 730ml presenting a microbiological risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"b6b70955-dfd7-41b2-b183-60b8c449e600","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-25T14:11:49+01:00","id":"b6b70955-dfd7-41b2-b183-60b8c449e600","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-25T14:11:49+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a8d94943b22fb169dc18d2c/2608-0103-product-recall-batches-of-simple-kind-to-skin.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Simple Kind to Skin Micellar Cleansing Water 200ml, 400ml and 730ml</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: It has been identified that affected batches may be microbiologically contaminated, which may cause eye inflammation.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Unilever.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming – Cleansing/Washing/Soap - Body</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Simple</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Poland</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>200ml, 400ml and 730ml bottles of micellar cleansing water. For a full list of identifiers, please see Annex A.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_b6b70955-dfd7-41b2-b183-60b8c449e600\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a8d94943b22fb169dc18d2c/2608-0103-product-recall-batches-of-simple-kind-to-skin.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"annex-a\">Annex A</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Size</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Batch Code</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>200ml</td>\n      <td>610041, 611641, 615941</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>400ml</td>\n      <td>611141, 611341, 611441, 613341, 613441, 614541, 614741, 614</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>730ml</td>\n      <td>613841, 613941, 611041, 616641, 616741</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>It has been identified that affected batches may be microbiologically contaminated, which may cause eye inflammation.</p>\n\n<p>The affected batches do not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 1223/2009 (the ‘Cosmetics Regulation’).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been withdrawn from the market and recalled from end users by Unilever.</p>\n\n<p>Consumers in possession of an affected batch should stop using the product immediately. Please access <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.simple.co.uk/product-recall-notice.html\">Simple Kind to Skin Recall Notice</a>  or contact your place of purchase for instructions on returns, disposal, and refund/redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2608-0103</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Recall scope expanded to include 200ml, 400ml products. ","public_timestamp":"2026-08-25T13:12:07Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-14T09:38:51Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"annex-a","level":3,"text":"Annex A"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users","withdrawal-of-product-from-market"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-14","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-14T10:38:51+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simple-730ml-kind-to-skin-micellar-cleansing-water-2608-0103","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simple-730ml-kind-to-skin-micellar-cleansing-water-2608-0103","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simple-730ml-kind-to-skin-micellar-cleansing-water-2608-0103","content_id":"c82ba2c3-a61c-428c-a27f-8ea621053c54","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-25T13:12:07Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Simple Kind to Skin Micellar Cleansing Water 200ml, 400ml and 730ml (2608-0103)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-simple-730ml-kind-to-skin-micellar-cleansing-water-2608-0103","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":tru